# The greeter runs unprivileged. Declaring the account here rather than in a
# post-install script means it is created the same way on every distribution
# and removed when the package is.
#
# The shell field is "-" rather than a path: nologin lives in /usr/bin on Arch
# and /usr/sbin on Debian and Fedora, and systemd substitutes its own build-time
# default, which is right on each.
u wdm - "wdm greeter" /var/lib/wdm -
